---

### Key decisions

| Choice | Reason |
|---|---|
| **`luxon`** | Already a Backstage transitive dep; avoids adding bundle weight |
| **`DateTime.fromISO`** | Strict ISO 8601 parsing with a built-in `.isValid` guard |
| **`.toRelative()`** | Locale-aware, handles both past and future, returns natural language |
| **Explicit error messages** | Surfaces `luxon`'s `invalidReason` for easier debugging in plugin logs |
| **`title` attribute on span** | Backstage UX pattern — shows the raw timestamp on hover as a tooltip |
